    "detailed_description": "<h1>REQUEST ACCESS (check the link on the right side of the screen)</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/0ba4deba93d3b9ca03a61de3037e579c.webp?t=1751201170\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/951dfcaa0180c45ef6ee290eb032909a.webp?t=1751201170\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/4378c7a23c0923f7d4d52c6703c074a5.webp?t=1751201170\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/401fc1ec5f52c8bdddafd1dc358b0550.webp?t=1751201170\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy the casual and easy TPS game Microvolts instead of hardcore or high stress one!</h2></strong><br>Due to the third person's wide view, you can quickly grasp and fight on numerous themed battlefields. To win the game, create your own winning strategy by using and switching weapons at the right moment.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/33457d41facb7e5cbde5a9198d297c68.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/33457d41facb7e5cbde5a9198d297c68.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/33457d41facb7e5cbde5a9198d297c68.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take the high ground with various modes and maps!!</h2></strong><br>Sometimes, the little things you overlook in your daily life can become crucial keys that lead the battlefield in Microvolts. Take a moment to open your eyes wide and examine places like your desk or under your chair that you've never paid attention to before. In those places, amidst the calm of everyday life, an intense battle like never before is unfolding. Experience and master Microvolts' unique and diverse game modes and maps to lead your team to victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/d3bb0d7cf7f33b8a6b9b382c185d4a28.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/d3bb0d7cf7f33b8a6b9b382c185d4a28.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/d3bb0d7cf7f33b8a6b9b382c185d4a28.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ff0e075907e052d0d4b72e96b463dd39.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ff0e075907e052d0d4b72e96b463dd39.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ff0e075907e052d0d4b72e96b463dd39.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Break through the limits of gameplay with the multi-weapon system!!</h2></strong><br>Melee: Kill enemies surrounding you with your strongest hit. Rifle: the most reliable weapon in your inventory. Shotgun: eliminate irritating enemies who try to get away from your sight. Sniper: an astonishing one-shot kill removes the opponent in the blink of an eye. Gatling: massacre attackers extensively with no mercy. Bazooka: its powerful gunfire aids in getting rid of ruthless specialists. Grenade: use an explosive attack to locate hiding competitors. Master all seven weapons' functions, and you may exceed your limits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/96a9923f3358fb5b532f529a85355e00.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/96a9923f3358fb5b532f529a85355e00.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/96a9923f3358fb5b532f529a85355e00.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be creative &amp; imaginative! Make your own personalized action figure!!</h2></strong><br>The ten unique costume parts are now available. Decorate your action figure with a variety of MVR apparel.<br>Collecting mission costumes by unlocking numerous hidden achievements &amp; completing extremely challenging missions.<br>Also don\u2019t forget to gather your own customized action figures!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/881145fe7b5f407d4986ee2de3de41e1.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/881145fe7b5f407d4986ee2de3de41e1.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/881145fe7b5f407d4986ee2de3de41e1.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ed0a7f3280ed3f106204473281c71de5.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ed0a7f3280ed3f106204473281c71de5.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ed0a7f3280ed3f106204473281c71de5.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Achieve True Battle Honor in the League!</h2></strong><br>Each player has the opportunity to test their combat skills and strategy, using their unique techniques and wisdom to overpower their opponents and prove their prowess through fierce matches.<br>Victory means more than just points\u2014it is a chance to showcase your honor and skills to the world.<br>Overcome your opponents, reach the top ranks, and become a legend of battle. Challenge yourself in the league now and fight fiercely for your honor!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ae7f96bc4e2beede5c613d4b1164706f.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ae7f96bc4e2beede5c613d4b1164706f.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/ae7f96bc4e2beede5c613d4b1164706f.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/4621df8ac7d3d28800f0e66c8ed1820b.poster.avif?t=1751201170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/4621df8ac7d3d28800f0e66c8ed1820b.webm?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1426440/extras/4621df8ac7d3d28800f0e66c8ed1820b.mp4?t=1751201170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
